<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Privacy Policy — Student Finance Overseas Calculator</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/fonts/fonts.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <header class="header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <div class="header-crown">
        <svg class="crown-icon" viewBox="0 0 36 36" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="22" cy="22" r="12" fill="#e8f0fb" stroke="#1d70b8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <ellipse cx="22" cy="22" rx="5.5" ry="12" stroke="#1d70b8" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5"/>
          <line x1="10" y1="22" x2="34" y2="22" stroke="#1d70b8" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5"/>
          <rect x="4" y="11" width="18" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#1d70b8"/>
          <polygon points="13,5 4,11 22,11" fill="#1d70b8"/>
          <line x1="22" y1="11" x2="22" y2="17" stroke="#1d70b8" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <circle cx="22" cy="18" r="1.5" fill="#1d70b8"/>
        </svg>
        <a href="/" class="header-title-link"><span class="header-title">Student Finance Overseas Repayment Calculator</span></a>
      </div>
      <nav class="header-nav">
        <% if (locals.userId) { %>
          <button data-href="/profile" class="header-nav-user">
            <span class="header-nav-avatar-sm"><%= (locals.userEmail || '?').charAt(0).toUpperCase() %></span>
            My profile
          </button>
        <% } else { %>
          <button data-href="/login" class="header-nav-link">Sign in</button>
          <button data-href="/register" class="header-nav-pill">Register</button>
        <% } %>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="main">
    <div class="container pp-container">

      <div class="page-heading">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Last updated: 4 May 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card pp-content">
        <p>
          We keep this short and plain. Here&rsquo;s what <strong>Student Finance Overseas Repayment Calculator</strong> collects, why we need it, and what you can do with it.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>The short version:</strong> we only collect what&rsquo;s needed to run the calculator. We don&rsquo;t sell your data. Third parties are limited to account email delivery through Resend and Google AdSense if you opt in.
        </p>
        <p>
          Operated by an individual based in Bayern, Germany &mdash; <a href="mailto:admin@mrinterbugs.uk">admin@mrinterbugs.uk</a>.
        </p>

        <hr class="form-divider">

        <h2>1. What we collect and why</h2>
        <p><strong>Account data</strong> (registered users only):</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email address</strong> &mdash; identifies your account and lets you sign in.</li>
          <li><strong>Account email delivery</strong> &mdash; your email address is sent to Resend so we can send confirmation and password reset links.</li>
          <li><strong>Graduation date</strong> (optional) &mdash; pre-fills the calculator.</li>
          <li><strong>Outstanding loan values</strong> (optional) &mdash; undergraduate and postgraduate loan balances you choose to save.</li>
          <li><strong>Calculator defaults</strong> (optional) &mdash; country, repayment plan, salary, and whether to include a Postgraduate Loan by default.</li>
          <li><strong>Calculation history</strong> &mdash; each time you run the calculator while signed in, we store the inputs (country, plan, tax year, salary) and the result (monthly repayment, threshold, exchange rate used). This is linked to your account and included in your data export.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Legal basis:</strong> Contract performance (Art.&nbsp;6(1)(b) GDPR) &mdash; needed to provide the account you signed up for.</p>

        <p><strong>Anonymous calculation inputs</strong> (visitors not signed in): when you run the calculator without an account, the same inputs and result are stored without any identifier &mdash; no account link, no IP address, no session ID. These records cannot be traced back to you and are used solely to understand aggregate usage of the service.</p>
        <p><strong>Legal basis:</strong> Legitimate interest (Art.&nbsp;6(1)(f) GDPR) &mdash; understanding how the calculator is used helps us keep it accurate and useful.</p>

        <p><strong>IP address</strong> (all visitors): used only to rate-limit requests and block abuse. Never written to a persistent log.</p>
        <p><strong>Legal basis:</strong> Legitimate interest (Art.&nbsp;6(1)(f) GDPR) &mdash; rate limiting keeps the service available and secure.</p>

        <p><strong>Strictly necessary cookies:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li><code>CookieConsent</code> &mdash; to store cookie consent preferences (1 year).</li>
          <li><code>connect.sid</code> &mdash; keeps you signed in (30 days).</li>
          <li><code>csrfToken</code> &mdash; prevents cross-site request forgery (session).</li>
          <li><code>selectedPlan</code>, <code>selectedCountry</code>, <code>selectedYear</code>, <code>includePg</code> &mdash; remember your calculator preferences (6 months).</li>
        </ul>
        <p>These cookies do not track you across other websites.</p>

        <p><strong>Advertising cookies</strong> (Google AdSense): ads are served by Google AdSense. Advertising and tracking cookies are <strong>only set after you give consent</strong> via the banner on your first visit. You can change or withdraw consent at any time from the link in the footer.</p>
        <p><strong>Legal basis:</strong> Consent (Art.&nbsp;6(1)(a) GDPR) &mdash; withdrawing consent doesn&rsquo;t affect anything that happened before.</p>

        <hr class="form-divider">

        <h2>2. Who we share data with</h2>
        <p>We share data only where needed to run the service:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Resend</strong> &mdash; transactional account emails, such as confirmation and password reset links. Resend receives the recipient email address and email content needed to deliver those messages.</li>
          <li><strong>Google LLC (AdSense)</strong> &mdash; advertising cookies, consented via the banner. Google may transfer data to the US under Standard Contractual Clauses. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google&rsquo;s Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell your data. Your account data is never shared with advertisers.</p>

        <hr class="form-divider">

        <h2>3. How long we keep data</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Account data</strong> &mdash; until you delete your account.</li>
          <li><strong>Calculation history</strong> (signed-in users) &mdash; until you delete your account, at which point all linked calculations are permanently removed.</li>
          <li><strong>Anonymous calculation inputs</strong> &mdash; retained indefinitely as they contain no personal identifiers.</li>
          <li><strong>Confirmation and password reset tokens</strong> &mdash; until used or expired, then cleaned up automatically.</li>
          <li><strong>Session data</strong> &mdash; 30 days from last activity.</li>
          <li><strong>Preference cookies</strong> &mdash; 6 months.</li>
          <li><strong>IP addresses</strong> &mdash; not stored (in-memory only).</li>
        </ul>

        <hr class="form-divider">

        <h2>4. Your rights</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Access</strong> &mdash; request a copy of the data we hold about you.</li>
          <li><strong>Rectification</strong> &mdash; correct inaccurate data via your <a href="/profile">profile page</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Erasure</strong> &mdash; delete your account and all data via your <a href="/profile">profile page</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Portability</strong> &mdash; download your account, saved profile data, and full calculation history as a machine-readable JSON file from your <a href="/profile">profile page</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Restriction</strong> &mdash; ask us to pause processing in certain circumstances.</li>
          <li><strong>Object</strong> &mdash; object to processing based on legitimate interest.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You can use the profile page for rectification, erasure, and portability. To exercise any other right, email <a href="mailto:admin@mrinterbugs.uk">admin@mrinterbugs.uk</a>. We will respond within one month.</p>

        <hr class="form-divider">

        <h2>5. Right to complain</h2>
        <p>If you&rsquo;re not happy with how we handle your data, you can contact the relevant regulator:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Germany (Bayern):</strong> <a href="https://www.lda.bayern.de" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bayerisches Landesamt f&uuml;r Datenschutzaufsicht (BayLDA)</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>United Kingdom:</strong> <a href="https://ico.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Information Commissioner&rsquo;s Office (ICO)</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Other EU countries:</strong> your national data protection authority.</li>
        </ul>

        <hr class="form-divider">

        <h2>6. Children</h2>
        <p>This service is not directed at anyone under 18. We do not knowingly collect data from children. If you believe a child has created an account, contact us and we will delete it promptly.</p>

        <hr class="form-divider">

        <h2>7. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>If we make significant changes, we&rsquo;ll update the &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date at the top and email registered users to let them know.</p>

        <hr class="form-divider">

        <h2>8. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about this policy, or want to exercise one of your rights? Drop us an email at <a href="mailto:admin@mrinterbugs.uk">admin@mrinterbugs.uk</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-note">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="7" cy="7" r="6.5" stroke="#8a9198"/>
          <path d="M7 6v4M7 4.5v.5" stroke="#8a9198" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        This is an estimate only. Verify with the <a href="https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/student-loans-company" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Student Loans Company</a>.
      </div>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</div>
<script src="/nav.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
